{{#with refund}}
<p class="greeting">Dear <strong>{{#if customer_name}}{{customer_name}}{{else}}Traveller{{/if}}</strong>,</p>

<p class="lead">
  Good news — your refund with <strong>Tanzania Safari Magic</strong> has been completed on our side.
  Please allow your bank a little more time if the funds have not yet landed in your account.
</p>

<p class="section-label">Completed refund</p>
<div class="data-card">
  {{#if refund_id}}
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Refund ID</span>
    <span class="value">{{refund_id}}</span>
  </div>
  {{/if}}
  {{#if booking_reference}}
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Booking reference</span>
    <span class="value">#{{booking_reference}}</span>
  </div>
  {{/if}}
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Refund amount</span>
    <span class="value">${{formatPrice amount}} USD</span>
  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Status</span>
    <span class="value"><span class="badge badge-success">Refund completed</span></span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="info-box success">
  <strong>Still planning Tanzania?</strong><br>
  Whenever you are ready, we would be honoured to rebuild an itinerary around new dates. Your history with us helps us tailor the next journey even more carefully.
</div>

<div class="cta-row">
  <a class="btn" href="{{#if site_url}}{{site_url}}{{else}}https://tanzaniasafarimagic.com{{/if}}/booking">Plan a new safari</a>
  <a class="btn-secondary" href="https://wa.me/255695108009">Talk to a consultant</a>
</div>

<p class="closing">Thank you for your understanding — we hope to welcome you to Tanzania another time.</p>
{{/with}}